nothing does, so the result is the 0-array:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"49a1f240-484d-9d4f-a83c-1b8cfbbecba8"],

Cell["ArrayMultiply[{{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}}, \"i,i\"]", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"032cd7d1-f627-7443-8d16-571ab175a9ad"],

